        <ExplanationTxt>TAX RETURN DRAFT PROVIDED TO EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR FOR REVIEW. THE EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR FORWARDS THE DRAFT TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOR THEIR APPROVAL BEFORE FILING. ONCE APPROVED, THE SCHOOL NOTIFIES THE PREPARING FIRM TO EFILE THE RETURN OR FINALIZE A PAPER COPY OF THE RETURN FOR THE SCHOOL'S MAILING.</ExplanationTxt>
