        <ExplanationTxt>DETAILED MONTHLY AND YEAR-TO-DATE FINANCIAL STATEMNETS ARE ATTACHED TO THE MINUTES OF EACH MONTHLY BOARD MEETING, CDE INTERIM FINANCIAL REPORTS AND UNAUDITED ACTUALS ARE APPROVED BY THE BOARD AND ATTACHED TO THE MINUTES TO THE BOARD. AUDIT REPORTS AND FORM 990 ARE REVIEWED BY THE BOARD AND ATTACHED TO THE MINUTES OF THE BOARD. ALL OF THE FOREGOING ARE AVAILABLE ONLINE AT THE SCHOOL'S WEBSITE AND CAN BE REVIEWED IN THE SCHOOL'S ADMINISTRATION OFFICE.</ExplanationTxt>
